      "content": "That makes sense. Can you go into more detail about the chemical mechanism? Specifically, why does the solubility of iron (Fe) and manganese (Mn) decrease as the pH increases toward 7.0? I need the actual chemical interaction or precipitation process explained so I can include it in the technical section of the report.",
